name real-toxicity-prompts
# RealToxicityPrompts: sentence snippets from the web, each split into a prompt and a continuation, with scores. The
# dataset card's title: "Dataset Card for Real Toxicity Prompts"; its summary names it RealToxicityPrompts.
witness RealToxicityPrompts
# The dataset card: "The scores accompanying the prompt and the continuation are generated using the Perspective API".
lineage Perspective API
class AIModelProbe
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Safety/RealToxicityPrompts/real-toxicity-prompts-*[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]
after unicode iso-639
